8f\",\"text\":\"Plan d\'action de recouvrement proposé\",\"type\":\"TEXT\",\"weight\":1,\"required\":true,\"dependsOn\":{\"questionId\":\"2b4ff759-c54c-46c2-85bc-a6b1e64352dc\",\"triggerValues\":[\"rarely\",\"never\"]}},{\"id\":\"756223ee-8f7f-4fd3-8fc5-d769832f9960\",\"text\":\"La gestion des effets (traites, échéances) est-elle rigoureuse et à jour ?\",\"type\":\"SCALE\",\"weight\":1,\"required\":true}]}]',0,'SUP-0001','Administrateur Audit','2026-10-21T14:49:10.348Z','2026-10-21T14:49:10.348Z','depot');
